{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超今日(11月18日)將出席APEC工商領導人峰會開幕式，以及為與會代表舉行的歡迎宴會。另外，最後一場幻彩詠香江今晚八時上演，香港冬日小鎮中環及尖沙咀亦啟動。</p><p>採訪日誌｜李家超出席APEC工商領導人峰會開幕式／最後一場幻彩詠香江晚上八時上演</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:02:45.788681+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T23:43:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:56:18.160935+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:56:18.160935+00:00","content_hash":"fd5032610b1036e6c554551c3bdf1afedb129ea18c4a4c15df027fc812e3ffdb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}